From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 13:56:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ports/arkweb: sync URL bar on history navigation

The URL bar only updated from onPageBegin/onPageEnd (LoadStatus), but
history back/forward reactivates a live pipeline without a fresh load, so
no load status fires and the URL bar went stale. Wire on_url_changed
(Servo notify_url_changed) to ArkWeb's OnRefreshAccessedHistory and have
the test app listen to onRefreshAccessedHistory. Also fixes URL-bar sync
for history.pushState/replaceState and fragment navigation.

Add test_urlbar.py regression test and a url_bar_text conftest helper.
Make the hilog read tolerant of non-UTF-8 bytes (errors="replace") so
log-reading tests don't flake.

Validation: Test by running uv run ports/arkweb/tools/test_urlbar.py on a device.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; implementation and on-device testing)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <jschwender@posteo.net>
